참조: [Data Visualization with ggplot2::Cheat Sheet "Labels and Legends"](https://rstudio.github.io/cheatsheets/html/data-visualization.html#labels-and-legends)


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code .code-overflow-wrap}
library(ggplot2)
n <- ggplot(mpg, aes(fl)) + geom_bar(aes(fill = fl))
p <- ggplot(mpg, aes(cty, hwy)) + geom_point(aes(shape = fl, size = cyl))
t <- ggplot(mpg, aes(cty, hwy)) + geom_point()
```
:::


#### 개요

labs() 함수를 사용하여 그래프의 라벨 요소들을 설정

::: {.callout-tip}

##### 라벨 및 색인

    labs(x = "New x axis label",
        y = "New y axis label",
        title = "Add a title above the plot",
        subtitle = "Add a subtitle below title",
        caption = "Add a caption below plot",
        alt = "Add alt text to the plot",
        <aes> = "New <aes> legend title")

:::


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
t
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-label_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png){width=672}
:::

```{.r .cell-code}
t + labs(x = "New x axis label",
         y = "New y axis label",
         title = "Add a title above the plot",
         subtitle = "Add a subtitle below title",
         caption = "Add a caption below plot",
         alt = "Add alt text to the plot")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-label_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-2.png){width=672}
:::
:::


#### 사용자 지정

##### annotate()


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
t + annotate(geom = "text", x = 8, y = 9, label = "A")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-label_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### guides()


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
p + guides(x = guide_axis(n.dodge = 2))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-label_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
n + guides(fill = "none")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-label_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### theme()


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
n + theme(legend.position = "bottom")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-label_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-6-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### scale_fill_discrete()


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
n + scale_fill_discrete(name = "Title", labels = c("A", "B", "C", "D", "E"))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-label_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-7-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::
